Package: alx-tune
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Algothix OS Maintainers <maintainers@algothix.com>
Installed-Size: 35
Depends: zram-tools, earlyoom, systemd, udev
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Homepage: https://algothix.com
Description: Hardware auto-tuner and resource-limit manager for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
 Detects system RAM, CPU AES-NI support, GPU driver, and disk rotational state
 at first boot, selects an ALX hardware profile (alx-profile-low or
 alx-profile-mid), configures zram (zstd, 50% RAM), earlyoom, fallback swap,
 I/O scheduler udev rules, per-user systemd slice memory limits, and disables
 unnecessary background services. Fully idempotent and re-runnable.
